#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""mm — the magic-moment command line.

The ONLY interface an agent needs. No sys.path bootstrapping, no heredoc
Python, no import gymnastics — write ONE screenplay.json and run:

    ./mm transcribe <video> --run <name>    -> RUN/mm_transcript.json
    ./mm validate  <screenplay.json>        -> exit 0/1, one-line errors
    ./mm render    <screenplay.json>        -> the internal MP4 for review
    ./mm inspect   <screenplay.json>        -> encoded state contact sheets
    ./mm publish   <screenplay.json>        -> reviewed, published MP4
    ./mm example                            -> a complete screenplay.json

Everything prints UNBUFFERED progress, errors are single actionable lines
(never tracebacks), and all output lands in the screenplay's run directory.
"""

